{"type":"record","name":"EqualLevelRecord","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.breakclass","doc":"T-5 (Level Absorption v2 section 6.9): the STANDING SET of the EQUAL_LEVEL (K1) objects one break-classifier timeframe holds at the end of one SPX bar, written by break-classifier-service to options.spx.market-structure.equal-levels, key scheduleId|timeframe|sessionDate. A WHOLE-SET snapshot: an object absent from the latest record of its key is gone (withdrawn). Prices are integer cents of the index. Written only when the producer's publish flag is on; revision is the session slot ordinal of the bar that produced the snapshot (monotone within one key, identical on a replay).","fields":[{"name":"schemaVersion","type":"int"},{"name":"parameterSetHash","type":"string"},{"name":"scheduleId","type":"string"},{"name":"timeframe","type":{"type":"enum","name":"Timeframe","symbols":["UNKNOWN","M1","M5","M15"],"default":"UNKNOWN"}},{"name":"sessionDate","type":"string"},{"name":"asOfMs","type":"long"},{"name":"revision","type":"long"},{"name":"objects","type":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"record","name":"EqualLevelObject","fields":[{"name":"objectId","type":"string"},{"name":"side","type":{"type":"enum","name":"Side","symbols":["UNKNOWN","HIGH","LOW"],"default":"UNKNOWN"}},{"name":"levelCents","type":"long"},{"name":"touchCount","type":"int"},{"name":"earliestOrdinal","type":"int"},{"name":"lifecycle","type":{"type":"enum","name":"Lifecycle","symbols":["UNKNOWN","LIVE","BREAK_PENDING","BROKEN"],"default":"UNKNOWN"}}]}}}]}